      "name": "MCP Pista Hielo",
      "webhookId": "c9954483-87fe-4a26-a15e-25a458bfb5de"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT \n    id, \n    start_time, \n    metadata->>'skate_number' as patin, \n    metadata->>'client_category' as tipo, \n    metadata->>'duration' as duracion_plan,\n    (EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (NOW() - (CURRENT_DATE + start_time)::timestamp)) / 60)::int as minutos_transcurridos\nFROM ph_transactions \nWHERE status = 'ACT'\nORDER BY start_time DESC;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgresTool",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        784,
        96
      ],
      "id": "eab1fc7e-6b5a-4cda-96e7-7b02fec57ed1",
      "name": "Ver Pista Activa",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "BQrod4uGVzM1nvLw",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Úsalo cuando pregunten quién está en la pista, qué patines están ocupados o cuánto tiempo llevan patinando las personas actualmente."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT \n    payment_method,\n    COUNT(*) as tickets,\n    SUM(amount) as total_dinero\nFROM ph_transactions\nWHERE \n    status = 'FIN' \n    AND transaction_date::date = CURRENT_DATE\nGROUP BY payment_method;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgresTool",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        912,
        96
      ],
      "id": "e1947053-d5cb-4540-b9ef-1f8f05d5b1be",
      "name": "Reporte Ventas Hoy",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "BQrod4uGVzM1nvLw",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Úsalo cuando pregunten cuánto se ha vendido hoy, el corte de caja o el total de ingresos del día."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT \n    full_name, \n    client_type, \n    membership_expiry, \n    is_vip,\n    notes\nFROM ph_clients \nWHERE full_name ILIKE '%' || {{ $fromAI.nombre_cliente }} || '%'\nLIMIT 5;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgresTool",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        1040,
        96
      ],
      "id": "1d46c3ae-462d-4248-8c27-262decf07de1",
      "name": "Buscar Cliente",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "BQrod4uGVzM1nvLw",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Úsalo para buscar información de un alumno o cliente por su nombre. Útil para ver vigencia de membresía."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT \n    t.id as ticket_id,\n    t.start_time,\n    t.metadata->>'client_category' as quien_lo_tiene\nFROM ph_transactions t\nWHERE \n    t.status = 'ACT' \n    AND t.metadata->>'skate_number' = '{{ $fromAI.numero_patin }}';",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgresTool",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        1168,
        96
      ],
      "id": "10c0bb1d-f5e5-4ecf-a705-c32062a50a98",
      "name": "Verificar Patin",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "BQrod4uGVzM1nvLw",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Úsalo cuando pregunten específicamente si un número de patín está disponible o quién lo tiene. El input debe ser el número (ej: '05')."
    }
